      "headline": "Senior Software Engineer at Yelp | Co-founder at TheGoldScarf | UK Global Talent | AWS and Google Cloud Expert",
      "about": "I’m Bolaji Akande, a passionate and high-achieving Software Engineer with a proven track record of crafting innovative software solutions that make a real impact. With extensive experience across multiple programming languages and technologies, I’m dedicated to pushing the boundaries of what’s possible in the tech world.\n\nMy expertise spans Python, Node.js, JavaScript, Laravel/PHP, and a solid understanding of both SQL and NoSQL databases, including MongoDB and DynamoDB. On the front-end, I excel in ReactJS and VueJS, while my cloud proficiency with AWS and Google Cloud empowers me to design and deploy cutting-edge, scalable solutions. I've also streamlined workflows using tools like GitHub Actions, Elastic Search, and Algolia, enhancing system performance for mission-critical applications.\n\nCurrently, I’m a Software Engineer at Yelp, where I drive impactful solutions across teams. Previously, I held roles such as Senior Backend Engineer at Iconscout and LottieFiles, and Technical Lead at Gokada, where I led teams to architect backend systems that scale globally.\n\nBeyond work, I’m committed to giving back to the tech community, especially through mentoring on platforms like ADPList, guiding the next generation of developers to succeed in their careers. I’ve also been an active speaker, working with organizations like Andela, Google, and Pluralsight, and sharing insights on cloud technologies and development best practices.\n\nI’m a certified AWS Cloud Practitioner, Google Cloud Associate Cloud Engineer, and Azure Heroes Kudos recipient. My work has been featured in publications like Azure Serverless September, and I’ve contributed to open-source initiatives, including Creative Commons, always striving to make technology more inclusive and accessible.\n\nLet’s connect and talk about how we can build the future of tech together.",
